 ## The moments and their boundaries
 
-- **Resumption:** `continuity-verify` fires before the arc when remembered state controls the next action. It re-anchors a state digest; it does not do the resumed work.
-- **Recon:** `blindspot-pass` makes the territory legible when micro-recon finds a material mismatch, hidden coupling, uncertainty, or fan-out risk. It ends at understanding.
